Build something

Usage: prog build [options] <main-source-file>

Positional arguments:
  <main-source-file>               Main source file                                                                     

Options:
  --mode <value>                   Raw string option                                                                    
  --name <value>                   String option                                                                        
  --count <value>                  Int option                                                                           
  --output,-o <value>              FilePath option                                                                      
  --target-os <value>              Another String option                                                                

Flags:
  --verbose                        Verbose output                                                                       
  --help,-h                        Print this help message                                                              
